'''Passion Land''' (情熱の国 ''Jōnetsu no Kuni'', '''Passion Land''') is the 2nd sub-chapter of [[Stories of Legend]]. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
This sub-chapter is extremely easy. It is almost as easy as [[The Legend Begins]], but the last level, [[Tapas Desert]], can be tricky: it introduces [[Master A.]], which is a very difficult enemy to deal with early on. Still, this sub-chapter is rather easy overall.
{{LegendDiff|150|200|300}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces one new enemy:
*[[Master A.]]: A long-ranged enemy who can deal heavy amounts of damage to your units over time and knockback your ranged attackers before they can get to him. This enemy even outranges [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] as well as many other heavy hitters, making him quite annoying to deal with.

